# Runtime Depends of ALL default community-apps (union of each app's
# omaxian.deps.json "apt" at the pinned Omaxian tag; also in omaxian-session
# Depends). Apps: disktree, folio, monologue, omacalc, omacut,
# omarchy-meeting-recorder, omawrite, plain, signed — installed from their
# pinned pre-built binaries (Omaxian v1.2.0+), seeded into every home via the
# omaxian-session home template; not optional. v1.2.0 adds libglib2.0-0t64
# (Folio) and libturbojpeg0 (Monologue).
